[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4320787801","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118958#issuecomment-4320787801","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118958","id":4320787801,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAYn9WQ","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-25T23:19:16Z","updated_at":"2026-04-25T23:19:16Z","body":"The way I see it, there are two solutions:\n1. Make it work as a \"last resort\", taking up the remaining space. This runs into some issues when multiple children have the flag, or when there are children with `SIZE_EXPAND` (or even worse, `SIZE_EXPAND_FILL`) flag.\n2. Remove the flag from the primary axis\n\nI would lean towards 2 since 1 comes with a lot of potential issues and edge cases that I don't think we want to introduce. Currently, `SIZE_FILL` acts exactly like `SIZE_SHRINK_BEGIN`, so removing the option to select it should be perfectly ok. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/